  m_Text: 'Create and anchor content to the world at any location using Device Maps.

    The
    local map can then be used to anchor any content at any location.

    The demo
    allows the user to place cubes that are anchored to the map they have created.

    The
    data is stored to files on your device meaning you can now save and share local
    maps and content.

    Click the "Scan" tab to start scanning.'
